== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: vcvtrops2hf8 [ENC: EVEX, MAP: MAP5, OPC: 0x38]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: CONVERT
    ISA-SET: AVX10_V2_AUX_128
    ISA-EXT: AVX512EVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: E4
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 C5 7D 09 38 47 01 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT     RCW     MODRM_REG    128     16       8   HFLOAT8                        xmm16
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R          MASK     64     64       1       INT                           k1
 2     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM    128      4      32   FLOAT32  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 r15
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000010
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 128
  BROADCAST: NONE
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: N
       MASK: k1 [MERGING]

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vcvtrops2hf8x 0x10(%r15), %xmm16 {%k1}
   RELATIVE: vcvtrops2hf8x 0x10(%r15), %xmm16 {%k1}

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vcvtrops2hf8 xmm16 {k1}, xmmword ptr ds:[r15+0x10]
   RELATIVE: vcvtrops2hf8 xmm16 {k1}, xmmword ptr ds:[r15+0x10]

